* fhi     2008-05-07 P304223  set default values for UNIX
* fhi     2009-11-16 P304569  Modify only if PF10 pressed
* fhi     2010-02-01 P304569  Show additionally record kind
* fhi     2010-05-26 P325613  Enhance node number validation
